 "description": "<p>A bunny girl interpretation in evening-dress form: chiffon dress with neck ring, in red, one size for 40-60 kg. Instead of the fitted bodysuit, this version runs a longer, dressed-up line - bunny styling for occasions the classic cut does not fit.</p>\n<p>The neck ring is the only accessory, and it is the right one - it carries the bunny reference while the dress does everything else. Red chiffon photographs warm, which is the intent.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: chiffon</li>\n<li>Includes: neck ring, dress</li>\n<li>Style: bunny girl evening</li>\n<li>Color: red</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The dinner-party answer to a category built for the club.</p>\n",
